			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Gut of the Cards"
			description: [
				"&dWell, like we mentioned before, Bandit, Cards and Card Decks are a mid-game mechanic."
				""
				"&5One we feel is too fun to keep to mid-game. Who doesn't like gathering and collecting cards like treasure?"
				""
				"&dExactly! And now you can craft them in this Deck Station."
				""
				"&5Aye, though most of them cannot be crafted unless ye unlock how to. "
				""
				"&dI'll try to sneak a way into the Deck Station to help point you in the right direction, Bandit. "
				""
				"&5Oh, ye should make the Starter deck real quick, the FOPs system looks out for it to see if ye have been progressing well."
			]
