		{
			title: "Keys to the Heart..."
			x: 1.0d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "...or At Least the Stomach"
			description: [
				"&dKeep an eye out in Gilded Chests, Bandit. See these little chunks of Keys you can find?"
				""
				"&5Start collecting em. They lead to great treasures!"
				""
				"&dTreasure Doors, specifically. You'll need a bunch of these Key Pieces, and some Vault Gems to turn into a named Vault Key"
				""
				"&5Unless ye get real lucky and find an unidentified Vault Key."
				""
				"&dLike the one we're about to give you, Bandit."
				""
				"&5Ye'll still need to find a Treasure Door to use it on. The one that matches the Key ye have. They'll be in the same spots in the Vault walls that Vendoors and Dungeon Doors are."
				""
				"&dOH, Bandit. In Treasure Rooms...don't forget to dig up ALL the sand as well!"
			]
