		{
			title: "Scavenger : Hacked!"
			x: 10.75d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "Looting Dreams and Nightmares"
			description: [
				"&dWe're going to call the Hacked variant of Scavengers an appropriate name : Unhinged Scavenger."
				""
				"&5This one is a doozy, Bandit. The system responds to the hack in two ways."
				""
				"&dThe first is that many of the existing Scavenger items will be moved to a different source. Like Ribcages and Skulls? Now they drop from Skeletons only."
				""
				"&5The second is why we call it Unhinged, Bandit. They more than double the number of Scavenger items you can find. Not even a Double Pouch can hold every Scavenger item!"
				""
				"&dThis means you have to hunt specific monsters, which only come from specific themes. Endermen are only in Void themes, for example."
				""
				"&5Don't worry though, we worked out a way to even the odds."
				""
				"&dYep. An Unhinged Scavenger Vault will ALWAYS be a Chaos theme. Meaning, rooms and monsters from ANY theme can show up."
			]
			dependencies: ["73F19D407DDBD157"]
			id: "5B34F626832B338B"
			tasks: [{
				id: "483FE360944D536A"
				type: "item"
