		{
			title: "Bin? Bing? Bingo? Bingoo? Bingooooo?"
			x: 3.75d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "My Board's Bigger!"
			description: [
				"&dOkay, I've found some leftover code for a thing called an Architect Vault. I think it was the predecessor to the Inscription system the FOPGame Server has now."
				""
				"&5I kind of remember em. Used to be ye could add a couple special rooms, and an extra room or two to get enough time to just ransack the special rooms and leave."
				""
				"&dFOP didn't like that lots of the normal looting was being ignored. Left lots untouched."
				""
				"&5When ye need more powerful gear to survive higher level, what do ye expect."
				""
				"&dTrue enough, bro. But hey, I can use this....lets test this here! The Seal of the Architect."
				""
				"&5I see what ye are doing, sis. I love it. Okay Bandit, if ye like Bingo, then check this out."
				""
				"&dThe Seal of the Architect is Bingo, but...expanded. The first Architect seal you add to a crystal makes it a 3x3 Bingo grid."
				""
				"&5And each additional one expands yer board. 4x4, 5x5, 6x6, etc."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
