		{
			title: "Rune Boss : Hacked!"
			x: 10.75d
			y: -0.75d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "Corporate Restructuring"
			description: [
				"&dAlright Bandit, there used to be a Vault Objective called Hunt the Guardians. You would find challenge Obelisks that would spawn a swarm of tough monsters to fight called Guardians. They eventually replaced that with the Rune Boss. We have a Hacked version of that old objective called : Slay the Brutal Bosses"
				""
				"&5Guardians were already pretty tough if ye didn't have a solid fighting build. In response to the hack, the system however will buff these Guardians even more to a Boss level."
				""
				"&dAye. These bosses can vary in shape and abilities, much like the Rune Boss can."
				""
				"&5They still have to be spawned at Obelisks, and the fight will be much tougher. These are actual corporate members of the FOP, just near the bottom of the totem pole. The Offering Bosses are more like...regional managers?"
				""
				"&dI've evened the odds for you, though. They should only spawn a single Brutal Boss at an Obelisk."
			]
			dependencies: ["73F19D407DDBD157"]
			id: "27D6F5C91318727E"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7CC05A50A36CB7F1"
