			y: 0.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Reward : A Gold Vaulter Box!"
			description: [
				"&dYou've been digging up all the Treasure Sand in the Treasure Rooms, right Bandit?"
				""
				"&5Lots o' treasure in em, ye know. Including these Lost Bounties."
				""
				"&dThey are kind of...partially old code that's still in the system. They are a bit of a mess. With that... I think we found another way in..."
				""
				"&5Collect these when ye can, Bandit. You can Right Click it onto a Bounty Table to take on a special Legendary Bounty, with much better rewards than a normal bounty."
				""
				"&dIt doesn't replace your normal bounty either. You can click the BIG bounty icon to read what your current Lost Bounty is."
