			subtitle: "A Prize on Display"
			description: [
				"&dWhen you finally get into a Treasure Room, Bandit, ye'll find at least one of these Treasure Pedestals in em."
				""
				"&5Unlike the Treasure Chest, there is only one piece of loot on a Treasure Pedestal. But this is the only way to get two of the rarest treasure rewards: The Treasure Card Deck, and a unique Treasure Magnet."
				""
				"&dGetting more than one in a Treasure Room is good luck!"
				""
				"&5Even if its one item, these are usually good ways of finding Wold Star Chunks, which ye'll want for high end items, Bandit."
			]
