				"&dGood cards, however..."
				""
				"&5Right. You'll start collecting tons of useless commons. Well, they aren't useless, but they are taking up room."
				""
				"&dThe FOP realized they could get useless cards back into circulation by letting throw them into the Vault Recycler to turn them into \"Card Juice\""
				""
				"&5Aye, which ye can take to the Card Upgrade Station. Put a card in the left side, add some Card Juice in the middle, and ye can hit the button to Upgrade the station."
				""
