		{
			title: "Peace and Quiet"
			x: 1.5d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "No Cap, For Real?"
			description: [
				"&dHmm, here's a fairly interesting Capstone I came up with, Bandit. I mixed it into the Treasure loot table, so it'll be fairly hard to find. But I don't want the FOP to find it easily so..."
				""
				"&5That sounds dangerous."
				""
				"&dNot to Bandit! See, it's called the Peaceful Capstone. Putting it on a Vault Crystal will remove all the mob spawners in that Vault."
				""
				"&5Okay that sounds very useful."
				""
				"&dBut also detrimental. Some of the Vault Objectives rely on mobs spawning from these spawners. Slay the Guardians is exempt, as activating a Obelisk isn't the same thing."
				""
				"&5Oh, but Challenge rooms like the X-Marks and the Raid Room don't use those spawners, right?"
				""
				"&dCorrect, those should still spawn a fight for you."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
