		{
			title: "The Toughest Battle"
			x: 16.25d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Wish We Had the Sword of the Cosmos..."
			description: [
				"&dOkay Bandit, some quick tips from us for this fight!"
				""
				"&5The Herald is split into multiple phases, one for each Vault God. I highly suggest some movement boosters, and yer best protective Gear."
				""
				"&dOne phase is a straight up fight. Watch out for AoE attacks!"
				""
				"&5Another is a charge up attack. Ye'll see glasses full of Time Sand or something in them. Run around and hit these before the charge up finishes!"
				""
				"&dThen there's what we call the Monster Mash phase. A lot will spawn in each wave, don't get bogged down!"
				""
				"&5Then the lootin phase. Ye need to find the Inhibitors in the Chests and throw em at the floating orbs."
				""
				"&dMight be a phase we're forgetting... but the faster you beat the Herald, the better Trophy you get."
			]
