			description: [
				"&dIf you are tired of opening Booster Packs and Jewel Pouches one by one, there's a tool you'll be interested in, Bandit."
				""
				"&5The bonus is that it'll let ye immediately Recycle the Jewel or Card if none of the choices are good."
