		{
			title: "Double, Double, Toil and Trouble"
			icon: "woldsvaults:brewing_altar"
			x: 5.5d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Nova Burn and Vaulter Bubble"
			description: [
				"&5Level 50 brings you a wide variety of new Objectives, including the newest one : Alchemy Vaults."
				""
				"&5Alchemy is a twist on Scavenger Vaults : Looting chests and killing monsters will occasionally get you Alchemy ingredients, which you use to brew potions that add to a Completion Bar and add effects to the Vault."
				""
				"&5Each ingredient either adds or subtracts from the completion bar. They also may have a positive or negative modifier attached to them."
				""
				"&5You'll need 3 Ingredients before you can put them into a Brewing Altar. If an ingredient has a modifier attached, it'll have a chance of being added when you brew it unless you add 3 of the same ingredient! "
				""
				"&5Reach 100% completion bar and exit the vault to Complete it! If you want to push your luck, you can keep brewing potions, and you'll be rewarded with higher Crate tiers! Though note that you can only overfill by the Completion bar by so much before you can't brew any more."
			]
			dependencies: ["504DC166104A8063"]
