		{
			title: "A Little Buddy"
			icon: "the_vault:companion_egg"
			x: 5.0d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "You Got a Friend in Me"
			description: [
				"&dStarting at Level 50, you have a small chance of getting a Companion Egg to spawn as you run normal Vaults."
				""
				"&5Companions are little creatures ye can catch and bring with ye into Vaults. They can provide powerful benefits, and level up to become even more powerful."
				""
				"&dThe Companion Egg will send a message in your chat when it spawns, where it will either spawn in a room you've already been in, OR in a room you added yourself with an Inscription. Look around, it will be giving off particles, but might be a bit hard to spot at first."
				""
				"&5Once ye have an egg, ye'll need a Companion Incubator to hatch it, Bandit. It can either be an animal, a mob, or another player. Ye can rename them (and change the player skin) with a Nametag."
				""
				"&dTo bring a Companion into a Vault, you'll need to put it on your Head Curios Slot."
			]
