			title: "Respec Your Companions"
			x: 6.0d
			y: -5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "No No No, Something Different!"
			description: [
				"&5Companions, when hatched, roll a Temporal Modifier. And sometimes, you don't want that Modifier, or ye already have multiple companions with it!"
				""
				"&dFor these situations, you can use a Companion Temporalizer! Place your Companion in a Companion Home, then Sneak + Right Click the Companion Temporalizer on the Home to reroll the Temporal Modifier."
			]
