		{
			title: "Companion Care"
			icon: "the_vault:companion_heal"
			x: 5.0d
			y: -4.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Headpats and Snacks"
			description: [
				"&dCompanions start out rolling a Temporal Modifier, a powerful ability that you can activate once per Vault (Check your keybinds, it may not be set!). This ability levels up and becomes stronger as the Companion levels up!"
				""
				"&5Making a Companion Home gives ye a place to put yer Companion, and also see its stats and change its equipment."
				""
				"&dYou can also dye the Companion Home the same way you dye Leather Armor (put any number of dyes + the home in a crafting table)."
				""
				"&5Companions can equip Companion Relics and Particles, which can be crafted in the Relic Crafting Table."
				""
				"&dCompanions also have Hearts. If you die in a Vault, your equipped Companion will lose a Heart as well. When a Companion has no hearts left, it will retire and can no longer help in a Vault."
				""
				"&5You can regenerate a Heart on a Companion by feeding it a Companion Snack. HOWEVER, you cannot heal a Companion that is RETIRED!"
			]
