		{
			title: "Winner Winner Crate Dinner"
			x: 7.75d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "A Tough Fought Reward"
			description: [
				"&dIn the Entrance, you'll find an NPC called the Royale Drafter. This NPC will offer you 3 Skill loadouts, randomly chosen from over a couple dozen. Any skill points not used with the loadouts can be used with Skill Scrolls. You can also go in 'skillless', but this is VERY difficult!"
				""
				"&5After the loadout, the Royale Drafter will offer ye two sets of Trinkets, which ye can select one from each group. And finally, a choice of reward for completing the Royale Vault."
				""
				"&dYou'll also have at least one Royale Loot Crate in the main room, containing a starting Vault Gear loadout of  : "
				"&d -1 Scrappy Weapon, 1 Paxel, 1 Scrappy set of Armor, Food, Healing, and Blocks."
				""
				"&5These Royale Loot Crates are also scattered in the Vault, looting them will help ye gear up to complete the Vault."
			]
