			description: [
				"&dAnother new type of Vault that opens up at level 50 is called the Vault Royale, a take on Battle Royale style games. You need to use a Royale Rock to create the crystal."
				""
				"&5The Royale Vault will choose a random objective to complete. All loot from chests, mobs, etc will go into a Royale Crate in yer inventory, which ye will only keep if ye complete the Vault. Ye cannot exit the portal early, so tis either all or nothing."
				""
				"&dObjectives that require items, such as Scavenger, will drop into your Inventory like normal however."
				""
				"&5When ye enter a Royale Vault, ye arrive with no skills or items (Ye'll get them back when ye leave, don't worry), and ye must gear and skill up while in the Vault."
