		{
			title: "A Roll of the Dungeon Dice"
			x: 7.75d
			y: -0.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Is This Gamblecore?"
			description: [
				"&dStarting at level 60, you have a chance of finding Imbuement Altars inside Dungeons. The larger the Dungeon, the higher the chance."
				""
				"&5Ye can place one piece of Vault Gear into the Imbuement Altar to gamble on upgrading a modifier on it."
				""
				"&dOnce you accept which Vault Gear you want to risk, you'll be presented with up to three options, and the chance of each succeeding."
				""
				"&5If ye win, the modifier ye chose becomes stronger and the Gear becomes Imbued!"
				""
				"&dIf you lose, the chosen modifier becomes weaker or is removed, and the Gear becomes Corrupted."
				""
				"&5Both Imbued and Corrupted gear cannot be further modified in the Artisan Station."
			]
