		{
			x: 6.0d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&dWe got a new tool for you, Bandit! Something I whipped up after talking with my brother about an old ability the FOPGame Server used to have."
				""
				"&5Aye, they were called Eternals. Could summon yerself a fighter to help you get through Vaults. Give it the appearance of yer friends or popular players."
				""
				"&dYeah, though they kind of deprecated it because of some bugs. One being... sometimes you'd get ghost copies of your Eternal running around. Lots of em after a while."
				""
				"&5Then my sis and I got talking, and came up with the idea... what if ye could have an army of Companions?"
				""
				"&dAnd Voila, the Companion Codex! You can store your companions in this block, and get yourself a Companion Crest from it. Equip that on your head instead of a companion and boom, little companion army!"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["171900B9A0193443"]
